# Allow-list: the build context is the repository root, but the image needs only the install and serve routes and
# the sidecar. Everything else stays out of the context (and so out of the image), including an engine installed
# into the clone (engine/) and a checkpoint downloaded into it (ckpt/, *.safetensors would otherwise be sent to the
# Docker daemon).
*
!LICENSE
!release/install-env.sh
!quant/kv_scales-swift-e4m3.json
!serve
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.bak*
**/*.safetensors
